{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月11日，據美國聯邦通信委員會（FCC）當地時間11月10日發佈的公告，<strong>SpaceX收購Grain Management旗下800MHz頻譜資產的相關申請已獲受理</strong>。<strong>此次交易涉及546張成對頻譜牌照，牌照覆蓋區域涉及約100%的美國人口</strong>，但交易仍需經過FCC後續審查。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585916.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.235684+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T07:39:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.419341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.419341+00:00","content_hash":"463ddd2a8a2955c155c9d068b4f401a3392fc57cfd39e9ec508e4c3738c2ff9e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}